# Blotout Design System

Applies to every piece of UI work (a component, a page, a style tweak, a UI bug fix) when `package.json` depends on `@blotoutio/design-system`, or when the developer asks to adopt it. Otherwise ignore this rule.

If the `design-system` skill is installed, follow it. This rule is the short version.

## Rules

- Every component and icon comes from `@blotoutio/design-system`. No shadcn copies, Radix, `@base-ui/react` directly, MUI, AntD, Chakra, `lucide-react` or `sonner`.
- Tokens only: `bg-background`, `bg-card`, `bg-muted`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `rounded-lg`. Status goes through `Badge` / `Alert` / `Banner` variants (by meaning), not status text tokens. No hex, no `bg-blue-500`, no `p-[13px]`, no inline colour/spacing styles.
- Check props in https://design.blotout.io/api.md. Examples in https://design.blotout.io/llms-full.txt can be stale; api.md wins.
- One `Button variant='default'` per view; others `outline`/`ghost`. Destructive actions confirm with `AlertDialog`. Results → `toast()` with `<Toaster />` at the root.
- Tables are borderless (no `Card` wrapper; `<Table bordered>` only when asked; not in DS 0.1.0, so there use a `rounded-lg border border-border` wrapper + `TODO(design-system)`). Row actions are icon-only `Button variant='link' size='icon-sm'` with `aria-label` + `Tooltip`; text labels only when asked; all actions inline, overflow menu only when asked or more than four.
- Settings / configuration pages are a stack of section rows, not titled cards: `<section className="flex flex-col gap-4 border-b py-6 last:border-b-0 lg:flex-row lg:gap-8">`, title + description left (`w-full lg:w-75 lg:shrink-0`), headerless `<Card className="flex-1 gap-4 p-4 md:p-6">` right, save button `w-full md:w-auto md:self-end`. Code-only section: code block on the right without a Card.

## Base UI pitfalls (shadcn habits that break)

1. `render={<Button />}`, never `asChild`. `Button` as a link: `nativeButton={false} render={<Link />}`.
2. Menu and command items use `onClick`; `onSelect` compiles but never fires.
3. `Select` needs `items` or the trigger shows raw values.
4. Errors: `<Field invalid={!!e}>` + `<FieldError match={!!e}>{e}</FieldError>`; without `match` the text never shows. `FieldGroup` is side-by-side columns; stack fields with `flex flex-col gap-4`.
5. Accordion/ToggleGroup: no `type`; values are arrays. Tabs style variant goes on `TabsList`. `CollapsibleContent` → `CollapsiblePanel`. Sheet → `Drawer direction`.
6. Toast: `toast.success({ title, description })`, `timeout` not `duration`, no `type` option.
7. Compiles but renders wrong: `AlertDialogHeader` needs `AlertDialogText` around title + description; `NavbarBrand` is a 36px logo slot (no text); DataTable columns via `col.columns([...])` without a type annotation; RadioCard/CheckboxCard/SwitchCard take no children; MetricText percent takes 12.6 not 0.126; `PaginationRange`/`PaginationControls` render nothing outside `Pagination`.

